   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Government Reform Programme II - Contigencies</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Local Government Reform Programme II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LGRP II (Decentralization by Devolution - D by D) objective is to achieve devolution of central government roles and functions to local government authorities, and to that end transform local government    authorities-(LGAs) to be competent strategic leaders and coordinators of socio-economic development, accountable, transparent in service    delivery and poverty reduction interventions in their areas.</narrative>
